# SH_MAMESOCK_KEYMAP — palmos placeholder, pending scripts/dev/mame-keymap.py
# KEYDUMP against a running rig (docs/lab/PALMOS-WAVE.md tracks the real one).
# palmiii's seven hardware buttons (mame/palm/palm.cpp INPUT_PORTS_START(palm),
# PORT_START("PORTD")) bind to plain PC keycodes by PORT_CODE, so the standard
# on-screen keyboard already reaches every one of them; this file exists only
# to give each a museum-facing label instead of a bare letter.
0x20	:PORTD	Power
0x15	:PORTD	Up
0x23	:PORTD	Down
0x21	:PORTD	Date Book
0x22	:PORTD	Address Book
0x24	:PORTD	To Do List
0x25	:PORTD	Memo Pad
